ting its options.\n- It works with the knight on c6 (which can later move to e5 or d4 to further restrict the king).\n- This is the most aggressive move to start pushing the king toward a corner or edge where checkmate is easier.\n- Other moves allow the White king more freedom.\n\nAnswer: B: e7-f6"}
